msgid ""
"Recent feedback export events. Use the status filter if you only need "
"failures or pending sends."
msgstr ""
"Nedávne exportné eventy feedbackov. Ak potrebuješ iba zlyhané alebo čakajúce"
" odoslania, použi filter stavov."

